Volumes 3-8 see the abandonment of this method and the use of segmented sections within each section of the index ie. Ab, Ac, Ad, and so on.&nbsp;This suggests that volumes 1 and 2 indexed prior registrations while the remaining volumes indexed registrations made from 1927.<br />
