recordkeeping_system:
Pupils&rsquo; registers are arranged in numerical order by register number, which is a sequential numerical identifier (eg. &ldquo;1&rdquo;, &ldquo;2&rdquo;, &ldquo;3&rdquo;, etc.) assigned to each student at the time of their enrolment.<br />
<br />
An Index to Pupils&rsquo; Register, would have also been maintained by the school, to facilitate the identification of students in the Pupils&rsquo; Register by name rather than register number, see VPRS 19619 Index to Pupils&rsquo; Register.&nbsp;

