function_content:
This series is comprised of the official annual school group photographs of the staff, classes/forms, year levels and/or entire school and form a visual record of the students and teachers at Kalianna School (School No. 4728 (VA 3950) at a point in time.<br />
<br />
There are not always photographs for every year and within a year period, there may or may not be a photograph for every class / form. The extent of the photographs within the series will vary depending on the school. &nbsp;Additionally, while most photographs list the names of the students and staff members included in the photograph there are some that are unidentified.&nbsp;

