function_content:
This series comprises minutes of meetings conducted by the Mount Buller and Mount Stirling Resort Management Board (VA 5714). The minutes include reports from the Chairman and CEO, as well as various reports from Board Sub-Committees such as the Risk, Audit and Finance Committee, the Strategy and Development Committee and the People, Remuneration and Culture Committee. They include updates on the strategic management of the Resorts, the corporate plan and budgeting, development projects, contacts, property and leasing.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
The minutes, which were required to be kept under the <em>Alpine Resorts (Management) Act </em>1997, contain the meeting agenda, full minutes and actions from the previous meeting, and any attachments of reports or updates provided by the Board members. As of 2018 the records were created and maintained in a digital format, with no known physical copies available. As such, some minutes do not have signatures from the Chairman but are the only existing copies.&nbsp;

